# Stock Market Fundamental Analysis using Python

This project performs live stock market fundamental analysis using Python and the Yahoo Finance API (`yfinance`). It fetches real-time financial data of major NSE-listed companies and analyzes important financial metrics such as PE Ratio, EPS, ROE, Profit Margin, Debt-to-Equity Ratio, and Revenue Growth.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- yFinance

## Features
- Live stock data fetching
- Fundamental analysis of multiple companies
- Sector-wise classification
- Financial metric comparison
- Structured DataFrame analysis

## Financial Metrics Included
- Current Price
- EPS (Earnings Per Share)
- PE Ratio
- ROE (Return on Equity)
- Debt-to-Equity Ratio
- Profit Margin
- Revenue Growth

## Companies Analyzed
- Reliance
- TCS
